#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/partials/dragon.adoc:3
msgid ""
"A {dragon} can fly, increasing its rider’s move to 100cm, and it adds "
"[.edit]#+3/3# Attacks to those of its rider."
msgstr ""
"Un {dragon} peut voler, augmentant le mouvement du cavalier à 100cm, et lui "
"ajoute [.edit]#+3/3# Attaques."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/partials/dragon.adoc:10
msgid ""
"[.edit]#The {dragon} can breath fire if the character has joined a unit that "
"isn’t engaged in combat.# This is a shooting attack with a range of 20cm, "
"which can be directed against one target as normal. The breath has 3 "
"Attacks, which are worked out in xref:rules:characters.adoc#characters-that-"
"shoot[the usual way]."
msgstr ""
"[.edit]#Le {dragon} peut utiliser son souffle si le cavalier a rejoint une "
"unité qui n’est pas engagée en combat.# C'est une attaque de tir avec une "
"portée de 20cm, qui peut viser une cible normalement. Le souffle inflige "
"trois Attaques qui sont résolues xref:rules:characters.adoc#characters-that-"
"shoot[normalement]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/partials/dragon.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Any unit joined by a character riding a {dragon} causes terror in its enemies"
msgstr ""
"Une unité rejointe par un personnage monté sur un {dragon} provoque la "
"terreur."
